{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016oUYsbFbfGzR1XwufMRTeG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"\n2\tCurrency information.\n3\t\n4\t``CURRENCIES`` data is from https://github.com/StorePilot/coinify,\n5\twhich is supposed to provide combined data from\n6\t\n7\t* https://gist.github.com/Fluidbyte/2973986\n8\t* https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217\n9\t* http://www.iotafinance.com/en/ISO-4217-Currency-Codes.html\n10\t* http://www.xe.com/symbols.php\n11\t\n12\tField meaning:\n13\t\n14\t* s - currency main symbol\n15\t* n - currency name  (currently unused)\n16\t* sn - currency native symbol\n17\t* d - decimal digits (currently unused)\n18\t* r - rounding (currently unused)\n19\t* np - currency name, plural (currently unused)\n20\t* sn2 - other currency symbols\n21\t\n22\tSome extra abbreviations are added to the list (they are set below\n23\t``CURRENCIES`` variable, scroll to the bottom).\n24\t\"\"\"\n25\t\n26\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n27\t\n28\tfrom itertools import chain\n29\tfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING, TypedDict\n30\t\n31\tif TYPE_CHECKING:\n32\t    # typing.NotRequired requires Python 3.11\n33\t    from typing_extensions import NotRequired\n34\t\n35\t\n36\tclass CurrencyInfo(TypedDict):\n37\t    s: str\n38\t    n: str\n39\t    sn: str\n40\t    d: int\n41\t    r: float\n42\t    np: str\n43\t    sn2: NotRequired[list[str]]\n44\t\n45\t\n46\tCURRENCIES: dict[str, CurrencyInfo] = {\n47\t    \"AED\": {\n48\t        \"s\": \"AED\",\n49\t        \"n\": \"United Arab Emirates Dirham\",\n50\t        \"sn\": \"د.إ.‏\",\n51\t        \"d\": 2,\n52\t        \"r\": 0,\n53\t        \"np\": \"UAE dirhams\",\n54\t    },\n55\t    \"AFN\": {\n56\t        \"s\": \"Af\",\n57\t        \"n\": \"Afghan Afghani\",\n58\t        \"sn\": \"؋\",\n59\t        \"d\": 0,\n60\t        \"r\": 0,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e466f724-2298-4937-a1d5-9fa3141dce7c","uuid":"2f17c42e-3aef-46f5-8901-474a54883d77","timestamp":"2026-